stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OPEN
    OPEN --> PROVISIONAL: C1 month ends
    PROVISIONAL --> PROVISIONAL: C3 reconciliation fails and exceptions are listed
    PROVISIONAL --> PROVISIONAL: C4 close lag passes and the period is flagged overdue
    PROVISIONAL --> CLOSE_READY: C2 invoices and minutes reconcile within tolerance
    CLOSE_READY --> CLOSED: C5 approved by someone other than the preparer
    CLOSED --> CLOSED: C6 correction written as a restatement in the open period

    note right of CLOSED
        Closed figures are never edited.
        A correction is a diff, never a mutation.
    end note

    note left of PROVISIONAL
        New calls land in the next period.
        Late events for this period queue as pending.
    end note
